&"type": ""
},
"11": {
&"character": "NPC 2",
&"id": "11",
&"next_id": "12",
&"static_id": "",
&"text": "Oh, this recent news is horrifying! I wonder how a man could do that?",
&"type": "dialogue"
},
"12": {
&"id": "12",
&"next_id": "13",
&"responses": PackedStringArray("12"),
&"static_id": "",
&"text": "What makes you think the culprit is a man?",
&"type": "response"
},
"13": {
&"character": "NPC 2",
&"id": "13",
&"next_id": "14",
&"static_id": "",
&"text": "Haven't you heard the rumors that she had a lover? Who knows, maybe they got into a fight and things go heated?",
&"type": "dialogue"
},
"14": {
&"id": "14",
&"is_snippet": false,
&"next_id": "end",
&"next_id_after": "",
&"type": "goto"
},
"15": {
&"id": "15",
&"next_id": "16",
&"type": ""
},
"16": {
&"id": "16",
&"next_id": "18",
&"type": "cue"
},
"17": {
&"id": "17",
&"next_id": "18",
&"type": ""
},
"18": {
&"character": "NPC 3",
&"id": "18",
&"next_id": "19",
&"static_id": "",
&"text": "I feel it's the mayor.",
&"type": "dialogue"
},
"19": {
&"id": "19",
&"next_id": "20",
&"responses": PackedStringArray("19"),
&"static_id": "",
&"text": "That's a serious accusation. Anything to back that up?",
&"type": "response"
},
"2": {
&"character": "NPC 1",
&"id": "2",
&"next_id": "3",
&"static_id": "",
&"text": "I feel the girl is faking her death... You never know.",
&"type": "dialogue"
},
"20": {
&"character": "NPC 3",
&"id": "20",
&"next_id": "23",
&"static_id": "",
&"text": "I suggest that you look into the election results of last year. Maybe you can find the poll results around the Mayor's office.",
&"type": "dialogue"
},
"22": {
&"id": "22",
&"next_id": "23",
&"type": ""
},
"23": {
&"id": "23",
&"is_snippet": false,
&"next_id": "end",
&"next_id_after": "",
&"type": "goto"
},
"24": {
&"id": "24",
&"next_id": "25",
&"type": ""
},
"25": {
&"id": "25",
&"next_id": "27",
&"type": "cue"
},
"26": {
&"id": "26",
&"next_id": "27",
&"type": ""
},
"27": {
&"character": "NPC 4",
&"id": "27",
&"next_id": "28",
&"static_id": "",
&"text": "Hey, if I was the killer I would hide in the bay area.",
&"type": "dialogue"
},
"28": {
&"id": "28",
&"is_snippet": false,
&"next_id": "end",
&"next_id_after": "",
&"type": "goto"
},
"29": {
&"id": "29",
&"next_id": "30",
&"type": ""
},
"3": {
&"id": "3",
&"next_id": "4",
&"responses": PackedStringArray("3", "5"),
&"static_id": "",
&"text": "Why would she fake her death?",
&"type": "response"
},
"30": {
&"id": "30",
&"next_id": "32",
&"type": "cue"
},
"31": {
&"id": "31",
&"next_id": "32",
&"type": ""
},
"32": {
&"character": "NPC 5",
&"id": "32",
&"next_id": "33",
&"static_id": "",
&"text": "Leave no stone unturned. The killer might've gotten clumsy and left something at the crime scene.",
&"type": "dialogue"
},
"33": {
&"id": "33",
&"is_snippet": false,
&"next_id": "end",
&"next_id_after": "",
&"type": "goto"
},
"34": {
&"id": "34",
&"next_id": "35",
&"type": ""
},
"35": {
&"id": "35",
&"next_id": "37",
&"type": "cue"
},
"36": {
&"id": "36",
&"next_id": "37",
&"type": ""
},
"37": {
&"character": "NPC 6",
&"id": "37",
&"next_id": "38",
&"static_id": "",
&"text": "The Mayor gave you a warrant, right? You should go check everyone's houses at the village. If they're really innocent they'd have nothing to hide.",
&"type": "dialogue"
},
"38": {
&"id": "38",
&"next_id": "39",
&"responses": PackedStringArray("38", "40"),
&"static_id": "",
&"text": "The killer could've easily planted false evidence.",
&"type": "response"
},
"39": {
&"character": "NPC 6",
&"id": "39",
&"next_id": "42",
&"static_id": "",
&"text": "I mean, it definitely doesn't help their case if you found the murder weapon at their house either.",
&"type": "dialogue"
},
"4": {
&"character": "NPC 1",
&"id": "4",
&"next_id": "7",
&"static_id": "",
&"text": "I've heard rumors that she wants to be left alone with her lover. So, this could be her chance.",
&"type": "dialogue"
},
"40": {
&"id": "40",
&"next_id": "41",
&"static_id": "",
&"text": "Thanks for the tip. I'll keep it in mind.",
&"type": "response"
},
"41": {
&"character": "NPC 6",
&"id": "41",
&"next_id": "42",
&"static_id": "",
&"text": "No problem. The faster you solve this case, the quicker things can get back to normal.",
&"type": "dialogue"
},
"42": {
&"id": "42",
&"is_snippet": false,
&"next_id": "end",
&"next_id_after": "",
&"type": "goto"
},
"43": {
&"id": "43",
&"next_id": "44",
&"type": ""
},
"44": {
&"id": "44",
&"next_id": "46",
&"type": "cue"
},
"45": {
&"id": "45",
&"next_id": "46",
&"type": ""
},
"46": {
&"character": "NPC 7",
&"id": "46",
&"next_id": "47",
&"static_id": "",
&"text": "Hey, Sherlock, here's something to think about. If the killer's really smart they'd plant evidence in people's houses. Hehehe...",
&"type": "dialogue"
},
"47": {
&"id": "47",
&"is_snippet": false,
&"next_id": "end",
&"next_id_after": "",
&"type": "goto"
},
"48": {
&"id": "48",
&"next_id": "49",
&"type": ""
},
"49": {
&"id": "49",
&"next_id": "51",
&"type": "cue"
},
"5": {
&"id": "5",
&"next_id": "6",
&"static_id": "",
&"text": "Are you saying the corpse at the crime scene isn't her?",
&"type": "response"
},
"50": {
&"id": "50",
&"next_id": "51",
&"type": ""
},
"51": {
&"character": "NPC 8",
&"id": "51",
&"next_id": "52",
&"static_id": "",
&"text": "Just between you and me - my guts tell me the real culprit is the bartender.",
&"type": "dialogue"
},
"52": {
&"id": "52",
&"next_id": "53",
&"responses": PackedStringArray("52", "54"),
&"static_id": "",
&"text": "What makes you think it's the bartender?",
&"type": "response"
},
"53": {
&"character": "NPC 8",
&"id": "53",
&"next_id": "57",
&"static_id": "",
&"text": "Think about it. They know the ins and outs of the town. The pub is the center of info around here. Seems like the perfect place to hush things to a rumor.",
&"type": "dialogue"
},
"54": {
&"id": "54",
&"next_id": "55",
&"static_id": "",
&"text": "And what would the bartender's motive be?",
&"type": "response"
},
"55": {
&"character": "NPC 8",
&"id": "55",
&"next_id": "56",
&"static_id": "",
&"text": "That girl who got murdered was nice, but she was a lot of handle at times. Could have just gotten fed up with her.",
&"type": "dialogue"
},
"56": {
&"character": "NPC 8",
&"id": "56",
&"next_id": "57",
&"static_id": "",
&"text": "Also, haven't you heard the rumors about the girl being involved in an affair? Maybe they were involved in it.",
&"type": "dialogue"
},
"57": {
&"id": "57",
&"is_snippet": false,
&"next_id": "end",
&"next_id_after": "",
&"type": "goto"
},
"58": {
&"id": "58",
&"next_id": "59",
&"type": ""
},
"59": {
&"id": "59",
&"next_id": "61",
&"type": "cue"
},
"6": {
&"character": "NPC 1",
&"id": "6",
&"next_id": "7",
&"static_id": "",
&"text": "Could be someone else, an identical twin. I don't know.",
&"type": "dialogue"
},
"60": {
&"id": "60",
&"next_id": "61",
&"type": ""
},
"61": {
&"character": "NPC 9",
&"id": "61",
&"next_id": "62",
&"static_id": "",
&"text": "Yo, nice outfit. Sometimes I like to play pretend too!",
&"type": "dialogue"
},
"62": {
&"id": "62",
&"is_snippet": false,
&"next_id": "end",
&"next_id_after": "",
&"type": "goto"
},
"63": {
&"id": "63",
&"next_id": "64",
&"type": ""
},
"64": {
&"id": "64",
&"next_id": "66",
&"type": "cue"
},
"65": {
&"id": "65",
&"next_id": "66",
&"type": ""
},
"66": {
&"character": "NPC 10",
&"id": "66",
&"next_id": "67",
&"static_id": "",
&"text": "Comeree... lad! Me friend is coming (Hic) to the... (Burp) island! Shoulddd be heeree tomorrow. He fishes for a livin'... Help him out and he'll help you (Hic)",
&"type": "dialogue"
},
"67": {
&"id": "67",
&"is_snippet": false,
&"next_id": "end",
&"next_id_after": "",
&"type": "goto"
},
